      "id": "claim_71a034064f924c369c99bf50d91bde55",
      "statement": "Ingestion accepts three input kinds over the draft and compile IPC channels handled in the main process: contract and blueprint are read deterministically without calling the configured model, text prefers the model when a generator is configured, and every result names the reader (contract, blueprint, text-rules or text-model) that produced the draft.",
