      "id": "claim_de32043f34a24f13abf30ac01f2cbc18",
      "statement": "The model ingestion reader starts a session in a fresh temporary project with noTools 'all', assembles the reply from text deltas, rethrows a recorded agent error after the turn, bounds the call with a 120 second timeout, and removes the temporary directory it created.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/desktop/src/main/ingestionModelReader.ts",
